* [2026-07-29] [Stage 4] CLEAN: Frontend-PWA/src/core/services/useListFilter.ts, Frontend-PWA/src/core/utils/sortStrategies.ts -- Candidate bottleneck investigated and DISPROVEN by measurement. Hypothesis: the three uncached localeCompare call sites in the list comparators (the name sort strategy plus the name/id tie-breaker, all running O(N log N) per sort and re-sorting on every keystroke) would be faster behind a single hoisted Intl.Collator. Implemented, then benchmarked on V8 v26.5.0 with 1000 names x 200 sorts, alternating measurement order across 3 rounds: localeCompare 27.0 ms mean vs hoisted Intl.Collator 87.4 ms mean, i.e. the "optimization" costs 3.24x MORE. Ordering was verified identical first (499500 pairwise comparisons, 0 sign mismatches; identical sorted output). Change reverted in full. V8 has a dedicated fast path for String.prototype.localeCompare that a user-constructed collator does not reach, and the production runtime is Android WebView on the same engine, so the measurement is representative. Existing code is already optimal.
* [2026-07-29] [Stage 4] CLEAN: Backend/supabase/database.types.ts -- knip reports this 1555-line file as unused. Not rot: it is an ADR-mandated artifact (CleanStack Architecture Section on Type Generation Parity requires supabase gen types typescript after every schema or RPC mutation) and was regenerated as recently as commit 2bc4f842. Deliberately imported by nothing; it exists as the schema-parity reference. Do not prune.
